# omnidict
===
 Fast, free offline dictionary for Linux. Download any of 600+ dictionaries (Wiktionary, WordNet, FreeDict, JMdict, CC-CEDICT) in 300+ languages and look up words instantly, with spelling suggestions, wildcard search and quick lookup from any app. Qt 6, C++.
